# Native captures of this machine. These are recordings of a real engine on
# a real disk, so they contain real Windows profile paths and real file
# names. They are local review artefacts, not source: see
# docs/native-captures/README.md for which of them may be published and
# why. They must never be committed by a blanket `git add`.
docs/native-captures/

# The native harness writes its real-machine screenshots to the repository
# root when it is given a relative --shots directory, which is what the CI
# does. Same reason: these show the real machine.
/native-captures/

# Local agent configuration, not a product file.
/.claude/

# A development-only preview page for the companion's states. The release
